## Progression

### Foundation Problems
Problems 01–08 focus on conditionals, calculations, input handling, validation, and business-rule logic.

### Data-Oriented Problems
Problems 09–12 introduce lists, dictionaries, records, grouping, aggregation, and structured processing.

### Current Practice
The repository continues to evolve with new challenges, refactoring, and stronger problem-analysis habits.

## Problem-Solving Approach

```text
Understand the requirements
    ↓
Break the problem into logic
    ↓
Implement a working solution
    ↓
Validate edge cases
    ↓
Review and improve readability
```

## Learning Philosophy

- Solve unfamiliar challenges independently
- Understand the concept before formalizing the solution
- Refactor for clarity and maintainability
- Keep earlier versions to show growth and learning progress

